<title>USA: CSCE board names new vice chairman and member.</title>
<headline>CSCE board names new vice chairman and member.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Coffee, Sugar and Cocoa Exchange (CSCE) said Wednesday its Board of Managers appointed Richard Esposito of Espo Commodities, Inc. as its vice chairman for a one-year term.</p>
<p>Additionally, Brain Kurtzer of Tri-Com Commodities was named to fill the board vacancy in the floor member category, the exchange said.</p>
<p>((-- New York Commodity Desk, +1 212 859 1640))</p>
</text>
